Russian:
Лояльность
<hint=hint_loyalty>Лояльность</hint> показывает, насколько лорд предан вашему <hint=hint_persons_king>королю</hint>. При значении ниже <red>25</red> лорд может уйти из поселения или поднять восстание.
{optional_loyalty_log}

English:
Loyalty
<hint=hint_loyalty>Loyalty</hint> indicates how devoted the lord is to their <hint=hint_persons_king>king</hint>. With a value below <red>25</red>, the lord may leave the settlement or start a rebellion.
{optional_loyalty_log}

English - final:
Loyalty
<hint=hint_loyalty>Loyalty</hint> indicates how devoted the lord is to their <hint=hint_persons_king>king</hint>. With a value below <red>25</red>, the lord may leave the settlement or start a rebellion.
{optional_loyalty_log}

Czech:
Věrnost
<hint=hint_loyalty>Věrnost</hint> udává, nakolik je lord oddaný svému <hint=hint_persons_king>králi</hint>. Když je tato hodnota pod <red>25</red>, může lord odejít z osady nebo rozpoutat vzpouru.
{optional_loyalty_log}

PortugueseBrazilian:
Lealdade
A <hint=hint_loyalty>Lealdade</hint> indica a devoção de um nobre a seu respectivo <hint=hint_persons_king>Rei</hint>. Com valores abaixo de <red>25</red>, o nobre talvez deixe a cidade ou comece uma rebelião.
{optional_loyalty_log}

Spanish:
